On authenticity: the goal is not to perform a presenter persona but to be a slightly clearer, slightly slower version of yourself. Copied mannerisms read as false, and an audience notices that faster than they notice a design flaw.',
      'Record yourself delivering two minutes on your phone. Listen back for pace — is it all one speed? Then deliver it again, deliberately pausing for two full seconds after your most important sentence, and compare.',
